  ERP_CUSTOMER // Paid plans for ERP subscribers
  COMPANY_CUSTOMER // Free plan for customers of subscriber companies (added by company staff or via e-commerce frontstore)
  ESSENTIAL // Paid: 1 company limit - for ERP subscribers
  GROWTH // Paid: 3 companies limit - for ERP subscribers
  ENTERPRISE // Paid: Unlimited companies - for ERP subscribers
  COMPANY_STAFF // Free plan for company staff users - no company creation rights
